<title>USA: Diagnon Corp says it will raise $2 million.</title>
<headline>Diagnon Corp says it will raise $2 million.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diagnon Corp said Wednesday it has made an exculsive agreement with Slusser Associates of New York to raise $2 million through a private placement.</p>
<p>The company said neither the structure of the offering nor whether it will consist of debt, equity, or a combination of the two has been determined.</p>
